            "value" : "Si lo desactivas, los demás no verán cuándo estás escribiendo y tú tampoco verás cuándo escriben ellos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，其他人看不到你正在输入，你也看不到他们正在输入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "關閉後，其他人看不到你正在輸入，你也看不到他們正在輸入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this is off, others don't see when you've read their messages, and you don't see when they've read yours." : {
